    10→//
    11→// GLOBAL_ROUTE_DESCRIPTORS are the DAG root nodes.
    12→// Items do NOT carry a "kind" field. To resolve an item's descriptor,
    13→// use the edge index: given a parent descriptor and an item id,
    14→// the edge tells you which descriptor the child resolves to.
    15→//
    16→// The breadcrumb stack is a path through this graph.
    17→
